description:
Design a circuit that performs the modulo operation, computing the remainder of the division of two 32-bit inputs, a and b. If b is zero, the output c will be set to zero to avoid division by zero. If a is less than b, c will be assigned the value of a. Otherwise, c will calculate the remainder by subtracting the product of the integer division of a by b from a.
module top_module(
  input [31:0] a,
  input [31:0] b,
  output reg [31:0] c
);

